Changes Since 2.0.0

Changed

- GitLab release job now uses the GitLab CLI (glab) to publish releases from CHANGELOG.
- README expanded with package overview, service registration, configuration, and feed serving guidance.
- RssFeedDataController no longer requires IRequestHostResolver.
- RssFeedPartialRouter returns null when a feed route does not match and uses segment span parsing.
- License and package metadata updated to 2026.

Build/Dependencies

- Added central package pins for Azure.Identity, Microsoft.Data.SqlClient, Microsoft.Identity.Client, System.IO.Packaging, and System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs.
- Package lock files refreshed to reflect dependency pins.
- Added CHANGELOG to solution items.
